{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1004928-book-of-weaver-anti-christ-juice","id":1004928,"title":"Book of Weaver: Anti Christ Juice?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-11-18T07:33:15-08:00","id":1004928,"title":"Book of Weaver: Anti Christ Juice?","content":"So, i was reading the Book of The Weaver and its mentioned the Anti Christ solution (prince of darkness reference). but i wanted to know if it ever comes up in the cannon or anything similar","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T08:24:39-08:00","id":1004954,"title":"","content":"No, it was there for the use of individual groups, most likely. That's what comes of rating N/A stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-18T14:20:57-08:00","id":1005101,"title":"","content":"I don't believe it ever did. It was just a neat McGuffin for Storytellers to use if they felt like it. When I used it, it was during a big crossover game (Demon, Mage, Orpheus, etc) the Anti-Christ Serum was the heart of the Grand Maw.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-21T22:42:03-08:00","id":1006594,"title":"","content":"I've toyed with using it. I may use it in the chronicle I'm currently writing as I re-center my efforts on my home county. If I use it I will probably use it as a warping effect set in a church converted to a lab/medical office and locate it near the county prison where it is drawing energy from the suffering of the prisoners....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-11-22T05:18:46-08:00","id":1006657,"title":"","content":"I've read somewhere that it contains one of the Talons of the Wyrm, but I don't really know if it's official or not.<br /> <br /> Ah, I've found it:<br /> <br /> &quot;Thrassus Thrice-Damned, Smallest- (or Fifth) Talon of the Wyrm: referenced in Book of the Weaver. Currently imprisoned in the Anti-Christ Serum, labeled in a classified storage facility as \u201cExhibit 338,\u201d location unknown (but maybe in Roswell, NM in Area 51?). The object imprisoning Thrassus Thrice-Damned appears to be a three-foot long, seamless glass capsule (but if the transparent material is indeed glass, it is of a type of glass that cannot be scratched or marred by any man-made instrument) containing a thick blue-green fluid of unknown substance. As the Smallest Talon, Thrassus Thrice-Damned may be the Talon of the Defiler Wyrm, but this is only non-canon speculation.<br /> <br /> The Sept of the Bygone Visions entry in Caerns: Places of Power had no references to an imprisoned Talon of the Wyrm. The only other reference to the Sept of the Bygone Visions mentioning the Talons of the Wyrm was in Book of the Weaver suggesting that since the discovery of the Anti-Christ Serum happened at the same time as &amp;quot;recent struggles at the Sept of Bygone Visions&amp;quot; the two incidents were somehow related which in turn suggested that the Anti-Christ Serum was Thrassus Thrice-Damned. I foundm another reference to the unnamed Talon held in the Sept of Bygone Visions on page 97 of Rage Across Russia in the same section describing Koschei.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/562-lachdanan","name":"Lachdanan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar562_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"261"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}